@startuml state_document
title Lifecycle dokumentu — diagram stanów

[*] --> uploaded : POST /upload\n(Ingestion API)

uploaded --> parsing : Parser consume\ndocument.uploaded
parsing --> parsed : tekst wyciągnięty\nzapisany w Mongo
parsing --> failed : błąd parsingu\n(corrupt PDF, OCR fail)

parsed --> chunking : Chunker consume\ndocument.parsed
chunking --> chunked : podzielony\nchunki w Mongo
chunking --> failed : błąd chunkingu

chunked --> embedding : Embedder consume\ndocument.chunked
embedding --> embedded : wektory wygenerowane
embedding --> failed : błąd / API rate limit\n/ timeout

embedded --> indexing : Indexer consume\nchunks.embedded
indexing --> indexed : wektory w Weaviate\nstats updated
indexing --> failed : błąd zapisu do Weaviate

indexed --> [*]

failed --> uploaded : retry przez Admin\n(re-trigger event)
failed --> [*] : porzuć / usuń

note right of failed
  Każde przejście do failed
  zachowuje error message
  w documents.status_history.
  Admin widzi w panelu.
end note

@enduml
